[{"title":"北山之高寿北山何先生","author":"金履祥","text":"北山之高，表我东底。\n惟山降神，生何夫子。\n维何夫子，文公是祖。\n是师黄父，以振我绪。\n翼翼夫子，令德在躬。\n道广心平，不外以衷。\n北山之阳，盘溪之将。\n以处以安，不骄不亢。\n昔在理宗，维道之崇。\n既表程朱，亦跻吕张。\n谓尔夫子，缵程朱绪。\n卿士率连，百辟咸誉。\n咨尔夫子，设教于乡。\n即命于家，长此泮宫。\n夫子曰辞，辞是好爵。\n玉几导扬，燕翼是托。\n明明天子，丕承皇考。\n曰求多闻，曰咨有道。\n天子曰都。\n咨尔夫子，为世宗儒。\n来游来歌，东观石渠。\n夫子曰止，臣非索隐。\n士各有志，亦既耄只。\n天子曰猷。\n咨尔夫子，汝予交修。\n讲殿维帷，尔优尔游。\n夫子曰道，惟帝之蹈。\n臣何容力，亦聿既耄。\n天子曰吁。\n鸿飞冥冥，罔终弃予。\n廪于宫祠，寓我渠渠。\n夫子由由，匪诡匪随。\n匪傲匪求，云受奚为。\n孑孑干旌，侯伯是将。\n凤皇于飞，亦集爰止。\n北山之阳，优优夷夷。\n盘溪之流，可以乐饥。\n明明天子，肇彼四海。\n乐学师贤，有永无怠。\n岩岩北山，其高极天。\n障此东南，利欲之澜。\n敢拜稽首，天子万年。\n充保四海，好德之端。\n敢拜夫子，眉寿无愆。\n金玉尔音，以永斯文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35922,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华之高寿鲁斋先生七十","author":"金履祥","text":"金华之高，其色苍苍。\n维华降神，生何及王。\n维王及何，文公孙子。\n天子是师，斯文之纪。\n翼翼王子，教行于东。\n思乐东州，舞雩之风。\n东人之子，其来秩秩。\n是追是琢，是进是服。\n有车班班，有来自东。\n子曰予耄，落此新宫。\n新宫岩岩，佩玉翩翩。\n毋曰予耄，而将闭关。\n自古在昔，圣贤有作。\n七十之龄，德烈方恪。\n于时阿衡，一德之书。\n于时尚父，犹蟠之居。\n于时宣尼，从心不踰。\n六籍是正，三千其徒。\n百里何为，亦显其君。\n武公九十，懿戒维新。\n屹屹王子，三寿作朋。\n视彼霸侯，曾是足论。\n嵬嵬王子，我人所宗。\n维北有斗，维岱在东。\n亹亹王子，毋遏来学。\n是洁是进，亦审亦度。\n毋信其言，省其退私。\n毋晦其明，而左右咨。\n明明天子，宅此四国。\n寤寐幽人，旌旄币帛。\n北山之阳，其及王子。\n毋然遁思，孤我帝祉。\n帝心孔翼，帝民孔棘。\n盍浚其源，而沛其泽。\n穆穆王子，毋靳尔猷。\n以永斯文，邦家之休。\n吉甫作颂，其诗孔陋。\n相彼兕觥，以介眉寿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35923,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑北山之元孙扁其楼王适庄为书北山之英四字求跋为作诗","author":"金履祥","text":"北山之高，屹屹南州。\n北山之英，尔公尔侯。\n诞此郑公，维国之器。\n有伟其才，有奇其气。\n不屑以洁，不震以强。\n权不离义，锻不柔刚。\n戎始归疆，人喜公虑。\n谓戎未觉，亟固我圉。\n既藩既宣，左秦右川。\n北仇方睦，西戎独严。\n壮兹远猷，卓兹伟志。\n一时之英，而不大试。\n高牙大纛，虎节铜符。\n东将宽民，乃公所馀。\n相维权奸，公以才忌。\n濒死荒陲，非公所悸。\n孰是叔季，而有斯人。\n孰是北山，而落其英。\n嗟我思公，去之百岁。\n思莫见之，见其后裔。\n维公之英，育多闻孙。\n尚继其志，而世其声。\n亦有适庄，景尔家世。\n北山之英，表此大字。\n北山之英，郑公之人。\n仰止攸同，矧其后昆。\n吉甫作颂，勉尔闻孙。\n郑公是似，北山之英。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35924,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽莲塘吴孺人 其二","author":"金履祥","text":"题汪功父所藏画卷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35925,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吉祥草","author":"王相","text":"得名良不恶，潇洒在山房。\n生意无休息，存心固久长。\n风霜徒自老，蜂蝶为谁忙。\n岁晚何人问，山空暮雨荒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35926,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"银树道上客怀 其二","author":"董嗣杲","text":"破舆不忍登，恐负看山眼。\n遥程入荒夐，栈道践?嵼。\n蹇载亦徒劳，登顿资笑莞。\n气馁不足苏，只得仰酒盏。\n暂免极寒侵，围春想歌板。\n何当位经纶，尽把凹凸刬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35927,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"坐暑病初招汪学老医次招黄平斋两公枘凿之甚病者反取多事而黄终奏药绩因有中秋共醉之约漫述长句","author":"董嗣杲","text":"卧病不知暑，况在英溪隅。\n入京涉夜航，药物艰所需。\n汪公业于医，其实真癯儒。\n医故不违理，非但以理拘。\n览镜面百皱，半月怯步趋。\n积忧那得解，肌瘠徒长吁。\n兹晨近秋中，疲惫凭杖扶。\n忽枉黄公驾，慰此困枥驹。\n指我伛偻形，旦暮耽书劬。\n病源肇于心，證与芝术殊。\n所嗟露电如，满岁罹艰虞。\n寒暑复见寇，阎浮可久图。\n行止任天造，其或诮以迂。\n凉轩聆欬唾，眷眷非世娱。\n浮荣信飘风，况复假合躯。\n堕落焦熬坑，难炼六一炉。\n感公致汤馈，瀹盏浮雪腴。\n仙传起死剂，顿醒爪发枯。\n西风捲茅屋，篝灯竹窗孤。\n蔬肠转阳脉，趣向归酒壶。\n谁传病退舍，可奈流俗徒。\n汪黄信可人，彼此皆枌榆。\n往缔中秋盟，未卜月有无。\n因拈二公姓，激我怀东都。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35928,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题城山道人庵 其二","author":"董嗣杲","text":"山晖丹气紫，路隐翠林香。\n野道依城社，山童执纪纲。\n田高秋敛薄，溪曲夜湍长。\n谇语令人倦，蚍蜉肯自量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35929,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"香林","author":"董嗣杲","text":"日月岩头古翠埋，锦云深隔洞门开。\n苍藤随石无根活，灵杞何年有种栽。\n气袅野烟疑麝过，暖熏山雨误蜂来。\n空亭谁领幽芬坐，云鹤同行损绿苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35930,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重游临武秀岩 其二","author":"曾晞颜","text":"十番春事付风埃，屐齿参经识苍苔。\n野鸟避人犹巧语，山花向日尽迟开。\n奇峰自是平地起，活水不知何处来。\n天若便教羁絷脱，宁须海上觅蓬莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35931,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦淮 其二","author":"吴龙翰","text":"歌歇陈宫玉树春，可怜商女亦成尘。\n老成惟有秦淮月，往日曾经照古人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35932,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬答鄱阳黎祥仲 其二","author":"张洪","text":"医和不可铸，空林芳菲菲。\n六丁护香珀，千岁以为期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35933,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"宋庆之","text":"数年何处客，昨夜独归船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35934,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"宋庆之","text":"飘泊知何处，艰难亦到僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35935,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"宋庆之","text":"更长初过雁，蛰后稍无蛩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35936,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄陈古堂 其二","author":"翁森","text":"怀人月千里，开门秋一林。\n徘徊不得寐，对此石上琴。\n山水有真领，寥寥本无音。\n寄语子钟子，须知琴外心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35937,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄进士熊退斋 其二","author":"李谨思","text":"殉义若殉财，避名如避箭。\n况当喜惧交，肯与宠辱战。\n百年元亮心，一日宣明面。\n朱门辙迹多，山路微如线。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35938,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出塞曲 其二","author":"张琰","text":"朝发山阳去，莫宿清水头。\n上马左右射，捷下如猕猴。\n先发服勇决，手提血髑髅。\n兵家互胜负，凡百慎前筹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35939,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出塞曲 其三","author":"张琰","text":"驱马饮淮水，千里黄草平。\n种谷却流血，痛哭秋风生。\n寡妻出租税，孤儿荷戈行。\n武威既不足，愿见和亲成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35940,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出塞曲 其四","author":"张琰","text":"军中日奏凯，鼓行辽海东。\n当宁怡玉色，千金劳成功。\n焉知昨日地，袒甲去如空。\n边人不敢语，将军益褒崇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35941,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"香者梅之气，白者梅之质。\n以为香不香，鼻孔有通窒。\n我有天者在，一白自不易。\n古人重伐木，惟恐变颜色。\n大雅久不作，此道岂常息。\n诗翁言外意，不能磨灭白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35942,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慧和尚三绝 其二 相","author":"文天祥","text":"风雪衡山涕满膺，懒残不管自家身。\n殷勤拨火分煨芋，却有工夫到别人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35943,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慧和尚三绝 其三 画","author":"文天祥","text":"花光老矣墨婆娑，无赖梅花一白何。\n为问西来宗旨道，世间色相是空么。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35944,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湘潭道中赠丁碧眼相士 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"收拾衡云作羽衣，便如屈子远游归。\n离骚忘却题天柱，为立斜阳问翠微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35945,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和衡守宋安序送行诗 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"方共衡云把酒杯，春风吹向郁孤台。\n雁将回处惊帆落，花未开时怯笛催。\n别草可堪游子去，寄梅应为故人来。\n临行笑觅凝香谱，十驾那追逸骥材。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35946,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"则堂 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"中书堂帖下诸城，摇首庭中号独清。\n此后方知枢密事，从今北地转相惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35947,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留远亭 其二 刘岊","author":"文天祥","text":"落得称呼浪子刘，樽前百媚佞旃裘。\n当年鲍老不如此，留远亭前犬也羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35948,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渡瓜洲 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"眼前风景异山河，无柰诸君笑语何。\n坐上有人正愁绝，胡儿便道是偻儸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35949,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州地分官 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"便当缟素驾戎车，畏贼何当畏虎如。\n看取摘星楼咫尺，可怜城下哭包胥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35950,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出海 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"水天一色玉空明，便似乘槎上太清。\n我爱东坡南海句，兹游奇绝冠平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35951,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六歌 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"有妹有妹家流离，良人去后携诸儿。\n北风吹沙塞草凄，穷猿惨淡将安归。\n去年哭母南海湄，三男一女同歔欷，惟汝不在割我肌。\n汝家零落母不知，母知岂有瞑目时。\n呜呼再歌兮歌孔悲，鹡鸰在原我何为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35952,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六歌 其三","author":"文天祥","text":"有女有女婉清扬，大者学帖临钟王，小者读字声琅琅。\n朔风吹衣白日黄，一双白璧委道傍。\n雁儿啄啄秋无粱，随母北首谁人将。\n呜呼三歌兮歌愈伤，非为儿女泪淋浪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35953,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六歌 其五","author":"文天祥","text":"有妾有妾今何如，大者手将玉蟾蜍，次者亲抱汗血驹。\n晨妆靓服临西湖，英英雁落飘璚琚。\n风花飞坠鸟鸣呼，金茎沆瀣浮污渠。\n天摧地裂龙凤殂，美人尘土何代无。\n呜呼五歌兮歌郁纡，为尔溯风立斯须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35954,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午初度 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"向来松下鹤，今日傍谁门。\n梦见瑶池沸，愁看玉垒昏。\n所思多死所，焉用独生存。\n可惜菖蒲老，风烟满故园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35955,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还司即事 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"秋声满南国，一叶此飘蓬。\n墙外千门迥，庭皋四壁空。\n谁家驴吼月，隔巷犬嘷风。\n灯暗人无寐，沉沉夜正中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35956,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"文天祥","text":"海阔南风慢，天昏北斗斜。\n孤臣伤失国，游子叹无家。\n官饭身如寄，征衣鬓欲华。\n越王台上望，家国在天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35957,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虎头山","author":"文天祥","text":"蚤不逃秦帝，终然陷楚囚。\n故园春草梦，旧国夕阳愁。\n妾妇生何益，男儿死未休。\n虎头山下路，挥泪忆虔州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35958,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"徐榛第一百三十四","author":"文天祥","text":"无正文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35959,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宴交代权赣州孙提刑致语口号 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"帘影晴丝落舞茵，崆峒云晚聚星辰。\n翠虹光度楼台月，香燕先浮霄汉春。\n一道清风华辔远，双江绿水綵衣新。\n相逢屡有朝花约，又看貂蝉会紫宸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35960,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠黄终晦","author":"文天祥","text":"钓鱼船上听吹笛，煨芋炉头看下棋。\n剩有晚愁归别浦，已无春梦到端闱。\n去年尚忆桃红处，好景重逢橘绿时。\n珍重山人招隐意，猿啼鹤啸白云飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35961,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闽峤军中","author":"陈某","text":"翠华齐拥霍嫖姚，却向青山说豹韬。\n兵马夜行残月下，弓旌寒响朔风高。\n壶浆故老愁啼血，野饭将军猛茹毛。\n自笑书生随玉帐，也腰刀剑束征袍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35962,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"贺德英","text":"只因错写天文表，流落人间一纪零。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35963,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画猿","author":"孙嵩","text":"客子平生三峡游，青猿树树悬高秋。\n归来落笔成天趣，中传蜀月巴云意。\n如何猿叫驿边时，只欠行人唱竹枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35964,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古三十一首 其十一","author":"释原妙","text":"泥佛不度水，毗岚风忽起。\n大地黑漫漫，衲僧争敢视。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35965,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古三十一首 其十二","author":"释原妙","text":"金佛不度炉，铁裹夜明珠。\n一槌俱粉碎，清光何处无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35966,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古三十一首 其十三","author":"释原妙","text":"木佛不度火，掣开金殿锁。\n内外绝遮栏，时人犹懡㦬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35967,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达磨祖师赞 其二","author":"释原妙","text":"未离西乾，恶声已布。\n面壁九年，一场败露。\n咦，不知赚却多少儿孙，直至如今钉桩摇橹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35968,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题渊明像 其二","author":"艾可翁","text":"仕晋何心更仕刘，知几闻早去来休。\n多君不肯腰轻折，非为区区县督邮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35969,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧山 其二","author":"姚云","text":"青莲山下玉泉寒，苍耳香中养白鹇。\n浪说来仙天地外，桃花流水只人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35970,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"牟及","text":"困雨葵心终向日，随风柳絮慢漫天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35971,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挂冠 其二","author":"李瓘","text":"有手须搴龙衮衣，有头须叩九阶墀。\n有口须读离骚词，有腹须饱商山芝。\n有身不愿挂绿皮，笑问此身到何之。\n石室山之颠，重湖水之湄，陶公云乐夫天命复奚疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35972,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"赵知军","text":"风吹沙草落日黄，鸦啄髑髅飞不起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35973,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观葵有感","author":"蔡必荐","text":"昨日一花开，今日一花开。\n今日花正好，昨日花已老。\n始知人老不如花，可惜落花君莫扫。\n人生不得长少年，莫负床头沽酒钱。\n得钱向酒家，君不见，戎葵花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35974,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日携客游武夷","author":"詹本","text":"山脚健枝梧，百里插苍峭。\n粼粼石可把，曙色坐远钓。\n风水真笙竽，历落太古调。\n衣冠带莽苍，山鬼惊二妙。\n云月正忘年，花鸟更索笑。\n回船翠凌乱，吾道付长啸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35975,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"曹良史","text":"云生画佛壁，叶落病僧房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35976,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"曹良史","text":"闲来闭门处，认得读书声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35977,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"曹良史","text":"深树月昏神火出，断烟雪霁猎人回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35978,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"曹良史","text":"墙围败屋知无主，风响荒林似有人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35979,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"曹良史","text":"驾犊渡溪水，夕阳满田畈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35980,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"载菊分题","author":"连文凤","text":"不用移春槛，西风满小车。\n行行无长物，粲粲只黄花。\n晚色装秋重，寒香引雾斜。\n辇来尊俎处，有酒不须赊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35981,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送黄爱梅过西湖 其二","author":"熊瑞","text":"朱顶千年去不回，两峰南北白云堆。\n谁人得似黄公子，不爱闲花尚爱梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35982,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题忠悯公送婿邢得昭归婺女诗后 其四","author":"徐木润","text":"仲方主和忝祖，知孝朋奸辱先。\n却是北山有后，可轩论奏凛然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35983,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"冯坦","text":"终日无人到，隔林惟鸟啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35984,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"冯坦","text":"雀舌收先雨，猫头掘带泥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35985,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"冯坦","text":"因听敲竹雨，便碎赏花心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35986,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"冯坦","text":"一春多是雨，四壁半生苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":35987,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]